   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAHO Reg Health phase out - PAHO Social protection</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PAHO Reg H&#xE4;lsoprogr utfas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a phasing-out support of the 2005 agreement with PAHO focusing on the sustainability of three initiatives: 1) Social Protection in Health 2) Reducing Gender and Ethnic Inequalities in Health and 3) Family and Community Health.</narrative>
